        <mxCell id="art_spa" parent="1" style="shape=module;align=left;spacingLeft=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#EBF1F5;strokeColor=#1F4E79;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;artifact&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Single Page Application (SPA)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• React / Next.js / Vue Frontend&lt;br&gt;• Admin Dashboard (SCR-ADM)&lt;br&gt;• Teacher Portal (SCR-TEA)&lt;br&gt;• Student Portal (SCR-STU)&lt;br&gt;• Staff Portal (SCR-STA)&lt;br&gt;• LocalStorage (JWT Token Store)&lt;br&gt;• Axios / Fetch API Client&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
